OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal for woman after house fire
OL,4,A'ruined my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMoira Deeprose says the first thing she
OL,7,Fknew about a fire at her home was when
OL,8,Fa neighbour knocked her door down and
OL,9,Fshe had to flee in just her nightdress
OL,10,Fand slippers.
OL,12,FShe said she "almost fell down the
OL,13,Fstairs" in her rush to get out of her
OL,14,Fhome in Quinton, Birmingham, before
OL,15,Fsomeone pulled her out through the
OL,16,Fdoor.
OL,18,FThe fire "ruined my life", she added,
OL,19,Fas she waits for a permanent home to
OL,20,Fmove into.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
